**Usage in this project**:
- Right foot bone, vessel, muscle, ligament, and calcaneal-tendon meshes extracted from BodyParts3D Release 4.0 OBJ data
- Files modified: cropped to right foot, converted to GLB format
- Derivative work: integrated into interactive 3D web viewer

